Dialogue: 1,0:01:51.13,0:01:54.09,OP_CHS,,0,0,0,,吸吸{\fsp10}吸{\fsp}give me give me 因{\fsp10}为{\fsp}mid-night mid-night
Dialogue: 1,0:01:54.09,0:01:57.09,OP_CHS,,0,0,0,,既然太阳之下 只会烧成灰烬
Dialogue: 1,0:01:57.09,0:02:00.43,OP_CHS,,0,0,0,,那不如趁着今晚 尽情嗨翻天
